.\" Predator Sense Linux
.TH PREDATOR-SENSE 1 "2026-10-18" "predator-sense 5.0.1463" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
predator-sense \- exact-clone of Acer Predator Sense GUI for Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B predator-sense
.RI [ electron-args... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Launches the GUI: the stock Acer Predator Sense renderer (Electron/Angular,
taken from the vendor installer) talking to a Linux service shim
(psense-electron main.js/backend.js) that implements the vendor MQTT/ddsc
packet service against
.BR psensed (8).
Pages verified on PHN16\-71: Home (live metrics), Scenario profiles,
Personal Settings \(em Battery & Charge (charge mode cards),
Checkup (battery/storage honest checks, RAM check honestly fails),
System Info (populated from /sys + SMBIOS), Monitoring, App Center
(XDG app launch), full lighting control (keyboard backlight palette,
zone colors, boot apply).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PS_SHOT / PS_CLICKS
Debug capture harness (development only — write PNGs and scripted clicks to
./debug next to the app).  Leave unset for normal use.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /opt/predator-sense/
the app (original renderer + node_modules + shim) installed by the rpm
.TP
.I ~/.config/predator-sense-linux-*.json
per-user state (lighting profile, tutorial flags, LaunchApp list)
.TP
.I /usr/share/applications/predator-sense.desktop
menu entry (icon from /usr/share/icons/hicolor/256x256/apps/)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR psensed (8),
.BR psense (1)
